{"id":"u-1dca52e7-81f4-4d56-9709-4aa8ed9ab03e","src":"community","title":"TBJP full body program","author":"Mersad Br","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/LL8pLS-tbjp-full-body-program","desc":"This full body hypertrophy program uses a high frequency and low volume approach. \n\nThe main goal of this program is to be building muscle and strength.  To do this our main priority is going to be beating the log book every week even if just by a rep or a couple pounds added each week. \n\nExercise execution is key as well. Standardization of your form is a must so stay with that exact technique week to week as you progressive overload.\n** if the rep is not there without having form breakdown don’t go for it**\n\nYOU ARE NOT PROGRESSING IF YOUR FORM CHANGES EVERY WEEK.\n\nThe split will be 4 days per week as standard, 3 days per week could also be done depending on your recovery capacity or time restraints.\n\n\nWe are trying to get the most out of each and every set, since there will only be one set per exercise we have to make the most of it. \nAll sets should be taken to OR close to failure, eg. 1RIR (except exercises with more inherent risk like SLDL’s these should be 1-2rir)","level":["Beginner","Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T02:12:38.360Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Full Body - A","Full Body - B","Full body - C","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Chest Press (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":9,"rpeHi":10}]},{"n":"Seated Shoulder Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":9,"rpeHi":10}]},{"n":"Wide Grip Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":9,"rpeHi":10}]},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":9,"rpeHi":10}]},{"n":"Single Arm Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":9,"rpeHi":10}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":9,"rpeHi":10}]},{"n":"Seated Hamstring Curl","sets":[{"l